!production-environment/ecom_sites/data/media/
production-environment/ecom_sites/data/media/**
!production-environment/ecom_sites/data/media/.gitkeep
production-environment/ecom_sites/data/wp/**
!production-environment/ecom_sites/data/wp/wp-content/
